{"id":1140201,"chapter_id":1140201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你推开审查室的门，发现这地窟中的幸存者正坐在座椅上，一边探头想要看清你桌子上的文件，一边摆弄着她的手铐。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1140209},{"step":2,"content":"其中一只拘束带，早已被她拆了下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1140209},{"step":3,"options":["……你做了什么？","你使用了异能？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201005,"trial_step":5,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"……你做了什么？","goto":6},{"text":"你使用了异能？","goto":null}]},{"step":4,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"唔——你别那么紧张嘛！露莉只是想四处看看而已，什么坏事都没做啦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1140208},{"step":5,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"可能是露莉的运气太好了吧？它自己掉下来了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1140208},{"step":6,"content":"限制禁闭者的工具无端脱落，你立即警惕起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1140209},{"step":7,"options":["准备启用枷锁"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"准备启用枷锁","goto":10}]},{"step":8,"content":"你准备启用枷锁，防止露莉艾卡对你不利。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1140209},{"step":9,"content":"但她的情绪并没有发生任何波动，也没有发动能力。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1140209},{"step":10,"content":"她就这样，一脸好奇又兴奋地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1140209},{"step":11,"content":"与进入审查室前，你所看到档案上的面庞别无二致。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1140209},{"step":12,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，这次的审查，请您一定要做足准备。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1140209},{"step":13,"content":"为什么？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1140209},{"step":14,"content":"你放下档案，向夜莺提出了自己的疑惑。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1140209},{"step":15,"content":"她看起来不是什么特别危险的禁闭者。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1140209},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我调查了露莉艾卡的资料，她的能力堪称“匪夷所思”。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1140209},{"step":17,"content":"夜莺将她手中的资料展示在你的面前。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1140209},{"step":18,"content":"x年x月x日，露莉艾卡在新城的x场子进行了三个小时的转盘游戏，期间共赢取了1300万数额的狄斯币，并只用一把左轮手枪击退了前来找麻烦的黑帮。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1140209},{"step":19,"content":"x年x月x日，露莉艾卡在一场转盘游戏取胜后，在辛迪加的x街区策划了一起爆炸，在炸弹起爆前露莉艾卡离爆炸中心仅有不足5米的距离，但事后却毫发无伤。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1140209},{"step":20,"content":"x年x月x日，露莉艾卡所在的帮派“四叶草”在其他帮派的偷袭下被尽数消灭，唯有露莉艾卡一人幸免于难。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1140209},{"step":21,"options":["她的异能是“幸运”么？"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201023,"trial_step":23,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"她的异能是“幸运”么？","goto":24}]},{"step":22,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是的，根据FAC的后续调查，证实了“幸运”便是她作为禁闭者的异能。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1140209},{"step":23,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"她的战斗技巧出色，战斗方式极为凶险。并且，她很大概率会是那个地窟“幕后”的人。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1140209},{"step":24,"content":"档案上频繁出现的“转盘游戏”一词引起了你的注意。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1140209},{"step":25,"content":"这转盘游戏……是她的什么娱乐手段么？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1140209},{"step":26,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"相当极端的游戏。有时候她并不会直接杀掉她的仇家，而是会留他们玩一些奇怪的游戏。而且这类游戏，通常都会用到一把左轮手枪。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1140209},{"step":27,"content":"那FAC有给出什么安全建议么？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1140209},{"step":28,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"针对她的能力，进行全面准备。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1140209},{"step":29,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"喂，局长？局长！你刚才怎么愣住了……难道说是看露莉看入迷了么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1140201},{"step":30,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"只不过是要陪露莉玩游戏而已，不需要这么紧张哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1140209},{"step":31,"options":["游戏？","你的情报呢？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"游戏？","goto":34},{"text":"你的情报呢？","goto":37}]},{"step":32,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"对呀！和露莉玩……嗯……真心话大冒险！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1140209},{"step":33,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"就是那种谁赢了就必须要回答对方一个问题的那种游戏。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1140209},{"step":34,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长玩过么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1140209,"next":[41]},{"step":35,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"忘了告诉局长……要先赢了露莉，让露莉输得心——甘——情——愿——","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1140202},{"step":36,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"才可以得到露莉身上的情报哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1140209},{"step":37,"content":"玩什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1140209},{"step":38,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……让露莉想想……不如就玩真心话大冒险吧！局长玩过么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1140209},{"step":39,"options":["玩过","没玩过"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201041,"trial_step":41,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"玩过","goto":42},{"text":"没玩过","goto":44}]},{"step":40,"content":"玩过，但只玩过几次。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1140209},{"step":41,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哎呀，那正好！只不过呢，局长不要以为玩过就可以赢过露莉了！这次的游戏规则有一点点变化哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1140208,"next":[46]},{"step":42,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"唉——局长肯定是没什么朋友吧。没关系，这次露莉陪你玩。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1140206},{"step":43,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不过相比普通的真心话大冒险，还是多了一点点的规则哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1140208},{"step":44,"content":"露莉艾卡突然露出了狡黠的笑容。你本能地感觉到，她所说的“一点点”一定不简单。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1140208},{"step":45,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"找一把左轮手枪，就是露莉平时常用的那种。枪里呢……有六个弹巢，你在里面只放一粒子弹。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1140208},{"step":46,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"然后枪口朝后，我们轮流扣动扳机。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1140208},{"step":47,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"分出胜负的方法就是一方死了或者一方放弃。非常old school的游戏哦，露莉特别喜欢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1140208},{"step":48,"options":["这真的是真心话大冒险？","你确定这不是其他的游戏？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201050,"trial_step":50,"course":3,"drawing":1140208,"choices":[{"text":"这真的是真心话大冒险？","goto":52},{"text":"你确定这不是其他的游戏？","goto":null}]},{"step":49,"content":"这分明就是档案上所写的“转盘游戏”！","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1140208},{"step":50,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"只是给这场真心话大冒险填一点彩头罢了！局长真是的！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1140211},{"step":51,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"当然，每扣动一次扳机，就有资格向对方问一个问题啦！而且不管是什么问题，对方都一定要回答哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1140209},{"step":52,"content":"什么问题都可以？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1140209},{"step":53,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"就算局长你问露莉多隐私的问题，露莉都会如实回答你哦——","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1140209},{"step":54,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长你可是抓到露莉了啊，说不定你的运气更好呢。说不定……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1140201},{"step":55,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"说不定你真的能问完所有问题！啊——想想都觉得刺激。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1140203},{"step":56,"content":"真要玩的话，以她的运气，你恐怕会输。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1140209},{"step":57,"content":"不过，你听从了夜莺的建议，提前做足了游戏准备。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1140209},{"step":58,"content":"于是你决定——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1140209},{"step":59,"content":"好吧，我答应和你玩这个游戏。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1140209},{"step":60,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"耶！！！露莉就知道，局长最好了！快开始吧！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1140208},{"step":61,"content":"但是你要保证，你的承诺一定有效。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1140208},{"step":62,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉当然说话算话！不过……局长，你也别想耍花招哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1140208},{"step":63,"content":"经过短暂的等待，露莉艾卡要求的爱枪被送到了审查室。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1140209},{"step":64,"content":"你将手枪递给露莉艾卡检查。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1140209},{"step":65,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":66,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":67,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":68,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":69,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":70,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":71,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":72,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":68,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":73,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不错嘛，动作这么麻利。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1140208},{"step":74,"content":"她将手枪翻来覆去地看，在最后转了一圈左轮后，才满意地将它放回了你的手上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1140208},{"step":75,"content":"于是你将弹巢打开，塞了一颗子弹进去。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1140208},{"step":76,"content":"弹巢转动发出“咔叽咔叽”的声响，让你看起来有了几个世纪前的“牛仔风格”，露莉艾卡甚至对着你吹了个口哨。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1140208},{"step":77,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"你也不赖嘛，局长！不过，记得到时候离露莉远一点哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1140209},{"step":78,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"点四五的子弹威力很大的，衣服要是被局长弄脏的话，可就麻烦了呀……嘿嘿。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1140209},{"step":79,"content":"露莉艾卡的气焰嚣张。不过，她确实有资格做出这种挑衅。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1140209},{"step":80,"content":"谁先开枪？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1140209},{"step":81,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长要抛硬币决定谁先开枪吗？要你先也可以哦，露莉不在意的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1140202},{"step":82,"options":["掷硬币","我先开枪吧"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201078,"trial_step":78,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"掷硬币","goto":79},{"text":"我先开枪吧","goto":87}]},{"step":83,"content":"露莉艾卡不知道从哪里摸出一枚狄斯币。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1140209},{"step":84,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……是露莉第三十三喜欢的游戏呢！那么……掷到正面是露莉先，反面就是局长先。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1140209},{"step":85,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"让露莉想想……为了给局长一些新人福利，就让你先吧！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1140209},{"step":86,"content":"不用刻意让我，开始吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1140209},{"step":87,"content":"露莉艾卡摇摇头，硬币被她抛至空中。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1140209},{"step":88,"content":"在空中旋转了几周后，它弹落在桌面上，发出刺耳的叮叮声，在你一度认为硬币要以正面呈在你的面前时，它却以一个近乎诡异的角度翻了个身。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1140209},{"step":89,"content":"是反面。你反复检查桌下是否有磁铁等物品，结果一无所获。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1140209},{"step":90,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"我说了哦——没有人能赢过露莉的强运！开枪吧，局长？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1140201,"next":[92]},{"step":91,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……好呀。明明局长是第一次玩，露莉本来还想让一让局长的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1140209},{"step":92,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"没想到局长居然这么着急……唉。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1140209},{"step":93,"content":"听说勇敢者会得到幸运之神的眷顾。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1140209},{"step":94,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈，露莉听过这种说法。那只不过是活下来的人自吹自擂罢了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1140203},{"step":95,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"运气不好的“勇敢者”，就只是不会说话的尸体哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1140203},{"step":96,"content":"枪口抵在太阳穴，触感冰冷，纵然你做足了准备，但还是感到一阵不适。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1140209},{"step":97,"content":"“咔哒”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1140209},{"step":98,"content":"弹巢发出了空转声，没中。对面的露莉艾卡鼓起掌来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1140209},{"step":99,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哇哦，厉害！露莉刚刚还担心局长第一轮就出局，这不是还挺厉害的吗！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1140208},{"step":100,"content":"这听着根本就不像恭维的话。你不在意，问出了第一个问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1140209},{"step":101,"options":["你为什么会出现在地窟？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"你为什么会出现在地窟？","goto":98}]},{"step":102,"content":"为了最快速解决问题，也是为了将风险降到最低，你直接提出了最关键的问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1140209},{"step":103,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"姆——怎么一上来就是这么难的问题呀！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1140206},{"step":104,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这个问题就当作是局长赢到最后的奖励好么？露莉可以允许你换一个问题哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1140206},{"step":105,"content":"露莉艾卡似乎在刻意回避你的问题。看起来，她也有所准备。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1140209},{"step":106,"options":["那你还知道关于地下的什么信息？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201102,"trial_step":102,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"那你还知道关于地下的什么信息？","goto":103}]},{"step":107,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"姆——这个也很直接啊……局长。不过，为了防止露莉被局长当成言而无信的人，露莉这次要回答你的问题！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1140206},{"step":108,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"让露莉想想……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1140201},{"step":109,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哦！对了，当时露莉刚吃完晚饭，在那边散步来着！然后就听到那个像洞窟一样的地方传出了枪声。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1140201},{"step":110,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"刚要下去的时候，就看到那一伙军团的人先出来，露莉连忙藏到一边，想着等他们走掉之后再下去，再之后……露莉就碰到局长你了呀！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1140202},{"step":111,"content":"就这么简单？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1140209},{"step":112,"content":"除此之外你真的什么都不知道？比如这地窟里面有什么东西？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1140209},{"step":113,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯！露莉真的只是第一次来这个地方！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1140209},{"step":114,"content":"很奇怪，按情报来看，她应该和地窟这个组织有关。但她的样子……又不像是在骗你。因为她既不知道这地下的狂厄武器，也不知道石棺。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1140209},{"step":115,"content":"这么说，她应该不是地下那群帮派的指挥者。怎么会有部下尽数牺牲，又丢了一批武器后这么优哉游哉的指挥者呢。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1140209},{"step":116,"content":"但你不敢冒险，你决定再详细询问。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1140209},{"step":117,"content":"那么你是隶属于——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1140209},{"step":118,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不行哦，局长，只有赢家才能继续提问了哦。再说……露莉还有好多想问局长的呢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1140207},{"step":119,"content":"没等你主动归还手枪，她就努力朝前挪了一下，拿走手枪并对准了自己的太阳穴，扣动了扳机。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1140207},{"step":120,"content":"理所当然地，什么事情都没有发生。但她并没有立刻把手枪还给你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1140207},{"step":121,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"现在，轮到局长回答露莉的问题了。告诉露莉吧，那个地窟底下究竟发生了什么。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1140207},{"step":122,"content":"他们贪图地下的狂厄武器，却经受不住污染变成怪物。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1140207},{"step":123,"content":"于是他们被我们消灭了，就这么简单。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1140207},{"step":124,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈哈哈哈……哈哈哈！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1140208},{"step":125,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"太好笑了！哈哈哈哈哈……好窝囊啊这群人！你说对不对？局长？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1140208},{"step":126,"content":"露莉艾卡开心地笑着。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1140208},{"step":127,"content":"这些人不过是恶有恶报罢了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1140209},{"step":128,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"……嗯。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1140209},{"step":129,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"到你了，局长。一定要再多玩几轮哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1140209},{"step":130,"content":"不知道是否是错觉，你从她的话语中听出一丝落寞。你不动声色地接过了她递上来的手枪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1140209},{"step":131,"content":"你扣动扳机——“咔哒”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1140209},{"step":132,"content":"没有子弹射出枪膛，你又逃过一劫。该问问题了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1140209},{"step":133,"options":["你隶属于哪个组织？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201129,"trial_step":129,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"你隶属于哪个组织？","goto":130}]},{"step":134,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……四叶草吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1140202},{"step":135,"content":"不是流浪儿？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1140209},{"step":136,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"比起流浪儿，露莉更接受自己是四叶草的首领哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1140209},{"step":137,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":138,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":139,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":140,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":141,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":142,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":143,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":133,"course":6,"drawing":1140209},{"step":144,"content":"你觉得一个人可以算是一个帮派么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1140209},{"step":145,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"真厉害！居然为了露莉调查到了这种地步么！就连现在四叶草只剩下露莉一个人都一清二楚！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1140208},{"step":146,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"让露莉猜猜……是不是现在这间审查室也是为露莉特别准备的？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1140208},{"step":147,"content":"抱歉，这是出于安全必要。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1140209},{"step":148,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"唉……这让露莉想起了以前的事。以前露莉也总是闯祸……不是炸了墙，就是拆了门。最后爸爸只能把家里的东西全都换成铁的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1140206},{"step":149,"content":"帮派里没人反感你么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1140209},{"step":150,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这应该算是一个问题的，但露莉很喜欢，就大发慈悲地回答你好了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1140209},{"step":151,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"四叶草的大家可是没有一个人讨厌露莉哦！露莉从小就是最受宠爱的幸运儿，就算闯了祸，只要和大家撒个娇就可以解决了哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1140209},{"step":152,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"对了，再告诉你一个重·磅·情·报哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1140209},{"step":153,"content":"你说。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1140209},{"step":154,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"就是——露莉的能力啊，是被大家宠出来的哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1140209},{"step":155,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1140209},{"step":156,"options":["挺新颖的。","哦。"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201146,"trial_step":146,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"挺新颖的。","goto":147},{"text":"哦。","goto":null}]},{"step":157,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"什么啊！这么冷淡！露莉可是要生气了，快把手枪给露莉！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1140211},{"step":158,"content":"她接过了手枪，对准了自己。猛地扣动了扳机。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1140207},{"step":159,"content":"“咔哒”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1140207},{"step":160,"content":"还是一样，什么都没发生。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1140207},{"step":161,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"轮到露莉提问啦。那批狂厄武器到底是从哪里来的？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1140209},{"step":162,"content":"你可以彻底确定，她一定不是地窟中那群帮派的首领，但却很想知道那群帮派的事情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1140209},{"step":163,"content":"是这群帮派和她有什么关系么？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1140209},{"step":164,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长，为什么不说话？是露莉的问题太难了么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1140203},{"step":165,"content":"地窟是狂厄武器的仓库。帮派们就是被狂厄武器引诱来的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1140209},{"step":166,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哦？露莉可从来没听说过有哪个帮派售卖狂厄武器，可以告诉露莉是谁卖给他们的么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1140209},{"step":167,"content":"是谁卖的已经不重要了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1140209},{"step":168,"options":["那只是个存放处"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201158,"trial_step":158,"course":3,"drawing":1140209,"choices":[{"text":"那只是个存放处","goto":159}]},{"step":169,"content":"所有东西都被军团毁了。无论是帮派，还是狂厄武器。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1140209},{"step":170,"content":"军团已经拯救了辛迪加，所有事情都已经划上句号了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1140209},{"step":171,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"军团……又是军团。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1140206},{"step":172,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"唉……总是慢上一步，太可惜了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1140206},{"step":173,"content":"露莉艾卡缓缓地叹了一口气，看起来对你的答案并不满意。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1140206},{"step":174,"content":"不过在她望向左轮时，却又兴奋地笑了起来。她缓缓向你举枪，像是递给你，又像是要冲你射击。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1140204},{"step":175,"content":"你无言地接过枪，对上了自己的太阳穴。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1140204},{"step":176,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1140208},{"step":177,"content":"露莉艾卡突然抑制不住地狂笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1140208},{"step":178,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"没想到真有你这样的傻子，第五枪了诶？露莉还是第一次这么过瘾！局长太棒了，最喜欢你了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1140208},{"step":179,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"所以啊，你对着肩膀还是别的什么地方打就行了。露莉可不想看见你的脑浆。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1140208},{"step":180,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"毕竟——能陪我玩这么久的人可就只有你一个。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1140208},{"step":181,"content":"你对她笑笑。你并不害怕，因为早就做了应对。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1140209},{"step":182,"content":"手枪是真的，但你在子弹中做了手脚。就算被射出，它也不会让任何人受伤。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1140209},{"step":183,"content":"你骗了露莉艾卡。不过，跟她这样强运的人玩游戏，从一开始就称不上公平。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1140209},{"step":184,"content":"一切都是为了真相，她显然也是为了从你这儿套出什么情报。现在，不妨再给她耍个帅。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1140209},{"step":185,"content":"不必，要玩游戏，就要输得起。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1140209},{"step":186,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"是吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1140203},{"step":187,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"那还真是可惜呢……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1140203},{"step":188,"content":"露莉艾卡一边笑着看着你，一边用右手猛击身下的椅子。你听到什么东西被解锁的声音。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1140203},{"step":189,"content":"她缓缓俯下身，从椅子下面掏出一把一模一样的左轮手枪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201179,"trial_step":179,"drawing":1140203},{"step":190,"content":"在你目瞪口呆的表情中，她朝着空气连开四枪，第五枪扣下去，枪管里射出一大堆彩色亮片，缓缓飘落到地上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201180,"trial_step":180,"drawing":1140204},{"step":191,"content":"她手上的枪，正是被做过手脚的安全品。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201182,"trial_step":182,"drawing":1140204},{"step":192,"content":"那，你手里的枪呢？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201183,"trial_step":183,"drawing":1140204},{"step":193,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"看好了，你手里的枪，可是有真子弹哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201184,"trial_step":184,"drawing":1140204},{"step":194,"content":"这个不按常理出牌的家伙，她是怎么把真枪带进审查室的？又是什么时候调的包？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201185,"trial_step":185,"drawing":1140204},{"step":195,"content":"百分之五十的几率，子弹会要了你的命。而你的对手是最强运的人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201186,"trial_step":186,"drawing":1140204},{"step":196,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长，你现在看起来才是真的有点紧张了哦，前面虽然演得还不错，但还差了一点火候呢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201187,"trial_step":187,"drawing":1140204},{"step":197,"content":"一滴冷汗沿着脊柱滑落。真的还有必要继续下去吗？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201188,"trial_step":188,"drawing":1140204},{"step":198,"options":["闭上眼睛，开枪","放弃开枪"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201189,"trial_step":189,"course":3,"drawing":1140204,"choices":[{"text":"闭上眼睛，开枪","goto":190},{"text":"放弃开枪","goto":197}]},{"step":199,"content":"“咔哒”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201190,"trial_step":190,"drawing":1140209},{"step":200,"content":"听到扳机卡进弹巢的瞬间，你的心跳停顿了一下。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201191,"trial_step":191,"drawing":1140209},{"step":201,"content":"是空的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201192,"trial_step":192,"drawing":1140209},{"step":202,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈……哈哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！有意思，有意思，太有意思了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201193,"trial_step":193,"drawing":1140208},{"step":203,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这还是第一次有人赢了露莉，是因为那个什么枷锁吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201194,"trial_step":194,"drawing":1140208},{"step":204,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"啊啊——无所谓，反正赢了就是赢了，露莉愿赌服输！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201195,"trial_step":195,"drawing":1140208},{"step":205,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这次露莉要回答局长最开始问的那个问题了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201196,"trial_step":196,"drawing":1140208,"next":[208]},{"step":206,"content":"我认输，狄斯城每天都在死人，不该是我，也不该是你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201197,"trial_step":197,"drawing":1140209},{"step":207,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"啧。没意思！太没意思了！明明就差最后一点了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201198,"trial_step":198,"drawing":1140203},{"step":208,"content":"你把手枪放在了桌上，打算呼叫警卫将这把凶器带走。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201199,"trial_step":199,"drawing":1140209},{"step":209,"content":"一抬头，你却发现露莉艾卡拿起了枪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201200,"trial_step":200,"drawing":1140209},{"step":210,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"既然局长没法决定的话，就让露莉来帮你做决定吧！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201201,"trial_step":201,"drawing":1140204},{"step":211,"content":"“咔哒”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201202,"trial_step":202,"drawing":1140204},{"step":212,"content":"还没等你反应过来，你便听到了扳机卡进弹巢的声音。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201203,"trial_step":203,"drawing":1140204},{"step":213,"content":"幸好，这一枪是空枪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201204,"trial_step":204,"drawing":1140204},{"step":214,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈……哈哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！有意思，有意思，太有意思了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201205,"trial_step":205,"drawing":1140205},{"step":215,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这还是第一次有人赢了露莉！这把枪……居然，居然没有响！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201206,"trial_step":206,"drawing":1140205},{"step":216,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉愿赌服输，这次就来回答局长最开始的那个问题吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201207,"trial_step":207,"drawing":1140205},{"step":217,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不过，在回答前，局长也要回答露莉的一个小问题。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201208,"trial_step":208,"drawing":1140205},{"step":218,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"你是不是早就猜到了露莉为什么会出现在那里呀，局长？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201209,"trial_step":209,"drawing":1140205},{"step":219,"options":["没有","有"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201210,"trial_step":210,"course":3,"drawing":1140205,"choices":[{"text":"没有","goto":211},{"text":"有","goto":213}]},{"step":220,"content":"我只知道你和那些帮派没有关系，你不是他们的头领。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201211,"trial_step":211,"drawing":1140204},{"step":221,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哼，说着不知道，不还是猜了个七七八八么。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201212,"trial_step":212,"drawing":1140204,"next":[217]},{"step":222,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不过，最重要的事你可没有猜中哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201213,"trial_step":213,"drawing":1140204},{"step":223,"content":"你和他们有交集，但一定不是互相交易的关系。并且，你和军团的目的相同。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201214,"trial_step":214,"drawing":1140204},{"step":224,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哦！好聪明啊局长！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201215,"trial_step":215,"drawing":1140204},{"step":225,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不过你还是没有全猜中哦，露莉不仅要消灭他们，还要完成露莉最重要的一件事。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201216,"trial_step":216,"drawing":1140204},{"step":226,"content":"是什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201217,"trial_step":217,"drawing":1140204},{"step":227,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉要让他们亲口说出，他们背后的人是谁！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201218,"trial_step":218,"drawing":1140205},{"step":228,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"在这之后……还要亲手把了结一切！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201219,"trial_step":219,"drawing":1140205},{"step":229,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉，要亲手复仇！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201220,"trial_step":220,"drawing":1140205},{"step":230,"options":["他们背后没人"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201221,"trial_step":221,"course":3,"drawing":1140205,"choices":[{"text":"他们背后没人","goto":222}]},{"step":231,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈哈哈哈啊……局长，你不觉得现在说这句话有点晚了么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201222,"trial_step":222,"drawing":1140205},{"step":232,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"你这么拼命地想要让我坐在这里，不也是想要找到帮派背后的那群人么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201223,"trial_step":223,"drawing":1140205},{"step":233,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"我们的利害关系一致。现在……我需要局长你，对露莉说实话。之后，我帮你处理那些垃圾，你只要坐在办公室里喝喝茶，看看文件就好啦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201224,"trial_step":224,"drawing":1140205},{"step":234,"content":"游戏已经结束了，这是第五颗子弹，下一颗一定是真的子弹。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201225,"trial_step":225,"drawing":1140205},{"step":235,"content":"到此为止吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201226,"trial_step":226,"drawing":1140205},{"step":236,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不……游戏没有结束，局长。如果露莉赢了，你要告诉我你所知道的一切！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201227,"trial_step":227,"drawing":1140205},{"step":237,"content":"你要干什么！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201228,"trial_step":228,"drawing":1140205},{"step":238,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"我从没失败过，以前不会，现在更不会！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201229,"trial_step":229,"drawing":1140205},{"step":239,"content":"她调转枪头指向了她自己。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201230,"trial_step":230,"drawing":1140207},{"step":240,"options":["阻止她！"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201231,"trial_step":231,"course":3,"drawing":1140207,"choices":[{"text":"阻止她！","goto":232}]},{"step":241,"content":"她直接扣下了扳机。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201232,"trial_step":232,"drawing":1140207},{"step":242,"content":"一切都发生在电光火石之间，你根本无暇思考，只能本能地扑过去夺枪。你失败了，但也谈不上失败。子弹在弹巢里炸开了。露莉艾卡的手被破碎的金属划伤。管理局内的警报声，也随之响起。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201233,"trial_step":233,"drawing":1140207},{"step":243,"content":"她的强运果真名不虚传，只要她自己想要活下来，就没人能让她死掉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201234,"trial_step":234,"drawing":1140210},{"step":244,"content":"而你，只能狼狈地从地上爬起，桌上的名单散落一地。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201235,"trial_step":235,"drawing":1140210},{"step":245,"content":"那是一组名单，一份正被你们密切关注的，曾跟地窟内帮派保有联系的帮派成员名单。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201236,"trial_step":236,"drawing":1140210},{"step":246,"content":"她的面色由于失血与疼痛而变得苍白，但目光始终没有移开那些名单。她脸上令人心悸的笑意，在此刻到达了极致。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201237,"trial_step":237,"drawing":1140210},{"step":247,"content":"露莉艾卡全然不顾自己的手伤，仍在那一堆名单中找出了想要的那一张。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201238,"trial_step":238,"drawing":1140210},{"step":248,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"这就是你那天在地窟里看过的东西吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201239,"trial_step":239,"drawing":1140210},{"step":249,"content":"你惊叹于露莉艾卡的记忆力，明明她只看过一眼，却记得如此清楚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201240,"trial_step":240,"drawing":1140210},{"step":250,"content":"如果没猜错的话，她今天的目标正是这张名单。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201241,"trial_step":241,"drawing":1140210},{"step":251,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"唉……没办法了，露莉也不想用这种办法的。谁让局长一直不肯说呢？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201242,"trial_step":242,"drawing":1140210},{"step":252,"content":"他们只是有嫌疑，你不要冲动。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201243,"trial_step":243,"drawing":1140210},{"step":253,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哦？有嫌疑？那就是说明……这上面的人，卖给过辛迪加帮派武器……对吧？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201244,"trial_step":244,"drawing":1140210},{"step":254,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201245,"trial_step":245,"drawing":1140210},{"step":255,"content":"你没办法否认，只能与露莉艾卡僵持着，直到审查室的大门从外部被紧急开启。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201246,"trial_step":246},{"step":256,"content":"行动队员鱼贯而入，他们用枪对准露莉艾卡，防止她做出进一步的过激举动。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201247,"trial_step":247},{"step":257,"content":"她受伤了，暂时没有威胁。让急救队员进来吧。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201248,"trial_step":248},{"step":258,"content":"急救队员随即将露莉艾卡放到了担架上。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201249,"trial_step":249},{"step":259,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长，我们辛迪加再见哦——","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201250,"trial_step":250},{"step":260,"content":"被急救队员抬出审查室的露莉艾卡，仍向你挥着她受伤的手。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201251,"trial_step":251},{"step":261,"content":"抱歉，我不能和你玩这么危险的游戏。有什么其他的游戏替代么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201255,"trial_step":255,"drawing":1140209},{"step":262,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"啊——没意思，难得露莉今天心情这么好，却被一个叫${PlayerName}的人伤透了心。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201256,"trial_step":256,"drawing":1140211},{"step":263,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"也好吧，既然局长不陪我玩，正好露莉还有别的事情要做呢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201257,"trial_step":257,"drawing":1140203},{"step":264,"content":"你感到一阵陌生的寒意，从她的笑眼中，带着一种失控的疯狂。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201259,"trial_step":259,"drawing":1140203},{"step":265,"content":"寂静的审查室中，响起了规律的滴答声。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201260,"trial_step":260,"drawing":1140203},{"step":266,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嘿嘿，既然局长不肯的话，露莉可要自己去找乐子咯——","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201261,"trial_step":261,"drawing":1140203},{"step":267,"content":"如同信号一般，露莉艾卡用左手轻轻叩了叩椅背。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201262,"trial_step":262,"drawing":1140203},{"step":268,"content":"你急忙想要划开审查室内部的参数面板，但气浪却先你一步将你掀翻在地。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201263,"trial_step":263,"drawing":1140203},{"step":269,"content":"轰隆——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201264,"trial_step":264,"drawing":1140203},{"step":270,"content":"审查室的墙在你背后被炸开，一时间内警铃大作。你不明白，为什么被异方晶加固的墙体会被露莉艾卡轻松爆破。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201265,"trial_step":265,"drawing":1140203},{"step":271,"content":"也不明白她这么做，究竟是为了什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201266,"trial_step":266,"drawing":1140203},{"step":272,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长——别想那么多啦！输在无敌的露莉手里，不算丢人哦！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201267,"trial_step":267,"drawing":1140210},{"step":273,"content":"尽管露莉艾卡被碎石溅得满身是伤，却仍是神气万分。她得意地晃了晃你放在桌子上的材料，从墙上的空洞一跃而下。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201268,"trial_step":268,"drawing":1140210},{"step":274,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"再见啦——局长——下次再见面的话，可要让我再尽兴一些哦——","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240201269,"trial_step":269,"drawing":1140210}]}